{"answer":"Two PRs for the real-time insights frontend components were not approved:

1. **Integrate Real-Time Data Processing for Insights** (PR #17) – https://github.com/salesforce/CoFoAIX/pull/17 — received CHANGES_REQUESTED/PENDING reviews (edge-case error handling and scalability issues raised).
2. **Enhance UI/UX for Real-Time Insights** (PR #25) – https://github.com/salesforce/CoFoAIX/pull/25 — one review was APPROVED, but the other reviewer's status is still PENDING (not approved)."}

